<title>POLAND: OCEAN SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>OCEAN SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.11 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.17 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.29 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Sales		    2.68 vs   2.05</p>
<p> JANUARY-SEPTEMBER    1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.11 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.91 vs   1.08</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.94 vs   1.02</p>
<p> Sales		   25.72 vs  20.28</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler and retailer is Ocean</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
